{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13498","headline":"复游浯溪 · 元友让","name":"复游浯溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔到才三岁，今来鬓已苍。\n剥苔看篆字，薙草觅书堂。\n引客登台上，呼童扫树旁。\n石渠疏拥水，门径斸藂篁。\n田地潜更主，林园尽废荒。\n悲凉问耆耋，疆界指垂杨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元友让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}